    text: 'For the spin-off AI Methods.',
  },
  {
    year: '2023',
    title: 'Luis Azcárraga Award, Fundación ENAIRE',
    text: 'National award for Baneshi, Simorgh and Soler, “Conflict Assessment and Resolution of Climate Optimal Aircraft Trajectories at Network Scale”, Transportation Research Part D, 2023.',
    url: 'https://fundacionenaire.es/actividad/xxviii-premios-aeronauticos-fundacion-enaire/',
  },
  {
